;; Cards a50ce32a/1b7f6a3e (mine :shaft: a declared mineshaft is descended and branched from), 644a840a (its cells stay open: the
;; mine's own tidy and mend do not refill them), e609bad0 (no usable shaft: the stair is suggested, :shaft :required refuses).
;; Soil 4 deep over stone (the plot walled in dirt so neighbours' stone is not walked to); body at [16.5 0 16.5] with a stone pickaxe.
;; A mineshaft plan "s" by the body: stair from [16 0 16] east down to y -4 (4 steps; the stone starts at y -5).
;; Should-succeed: with the plan the run says "via shaft s", the stair cells stay air; without it the end text suggests plans.mjs mineshaft.
;; Should-fail: :shaft :required with no plan ends :no-shaft, got 0, nothing dug.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:mine :mineshaft :stair :jobs] :time :any
  :plot {:height 12 :floor "dirt"}
  :blocks [[:fill [0 -9 0] [31 -5 31] "stone"] [:fill [0 -4 0] [31 -1 31] "dirt"] [:fill [0 -4 0] [31 6 0] "dirt"] [:fill [0 -4 31] [31 6 31] "dirt"]
           [:fill [0 -4 0] [0 6 31] "dirt"] [:fill [31 -4 0] [31 6 31] "dirt"]]
  :body {:at [16.5 0 16.5] :effects [["resistance" 600 4]] :inventory [["stone_pickaxe" 1]]}
  :limit-s 150}
 :cases
 [{:name "declared-shaft-is-descended-and-its-cells-stay-open"
   :plans [{:id "s" :kind :mineshaft :metadata {:by "$body"}
            :parts [{:id "stair" :stair {:from #at [16 0 16] :heading :east :to-y -4} :want :clear}]}]
   :act [[:job (jobs.gather.mine {:block "stone" :count 4 :direction :east :tunnel-length 8 :radius 8})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :mine.done :data {:got [:>= 4] :text [:contains "via shaft s"]}} :within-s 130 :of-job true}]
   :after [[:not-block [17 -1 16] "dirt"] [:not-block [19 -3 16] "dirt"] [:item "cobblestone" [:>= 4]]]}
  {:name "no-shaft-stair-is-cut-and-declaring-it-is-suggested"
   :act [[:job (jobs.gather.mine {:block "stone" :count 4 :direction :east :tunnel-length 8 :radius 8})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :mine.done :data {:got [:>= 4] :shaft-suggest {:to-y [:any]} :text [:contains "plans.mjs mineshaft"]}} :within-s 130 :of-job true}]
   :after [[:item "cobblestone" [:>= 4]]]}
  {:name "shaft-required-without-a-shaft-digs-nothing"
   :act [[:job (jobs.gather.mine {:block "stone" :count 4 :direction :east :tunnel-length 8 :radius 8 :shaft :required})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :mine.done :data {:got 0 :reason :no-shaft}} :within-s 60 :of-job true}]
   :after [[:block [17 -1 16] "dirt"] [:block [16 -1 16] "dirt"] [:item "cobblestone" 0]]}]}
